LangString SnowShotClosePrompt 1033 "${SNOW_SHOT_INSTALLER_PRODUCT_NAME} is running. Close it to continue setup? Unsaved screenshots and recordings may be lost."
LangString SnowShotCloseFailed 1033 "Setup could not close ${SNOW_SHOT_INSTALLER_PRODUCT_NAME} or check whether it is running. Close ${SNOW_SHOT_INSTALLER_PRODUCT_NAME} manually, then run setup again."
LangString SnowShotLanguageTitle 1033 "${SNOW_SHOT_INSTALLER_PRODUCT_NAME} Setup Language"
LangString SnowShotLanguagePrompt 1033 "Please select a language."
LangString SnowShotUpgradePrompt 1033 "$1 is already installed. $\n$\nDo you want to uninstall the old version before installing the new one?"
LangString SnowShotUninstallFailed 1033 "Uninstall failed."
LangString SnowShotOptionsTitle 1033 "Install Options"
LangString SnowShotOptionsDescription 1033 "Choose options for installing ${SNOW_SHOT_INSTALLER_PRODUCT_NAME}."
LangString SnowShotPathDescription 1033 "By default ${SNOW_SHOT_INSTALLER_PRODUCT_NAME} does not add its directory to the system PATH."
LangString SnowShotPathNone 1033 "Do not add ${SNOW_SHOT_INSTALLER_PRODUCT_NAME} to the system PATH"
